## 📊 **CodeQL Query Metadata for Governance**

Use query metadata to categorize and prioritize findings. Metadata can be used in dashboards or CI decisions.

```ql
/**
 * @name SQL injection in string concatenation
 * @id java/sql-injection-concat
 * @description Building SQL queries with string concatenation is vulnerable.
 * @kind path-problem
 * @problem.severity error
 * @precision high
 * @tags security
 * @security-severity 8.2
 * @cwe id="89", name="SQL Injection"
 */
```

You can then filter results by severity or CWE in your CI pipeline:
```yaml
- name: Filter results
  run: |
    jq '.runs[].results[] | select(.properties."security-severity" > 7.0)' results.sarif
```

